{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":4324903,"ns":0,"title":"BigDog","extract":"BigDog is a dynamically stable  quadruped military robot platform that was created in 2005 by Boston Dynamics with the Harvard University Concord Field Station. It was funded by the U.S. Defense Advanced Research Projects Agency (DARPA), but the project was shelved after the BigDog's gas engine was deemed too loud for combat.","description":"Quadruped robot built by Boston Dynamics","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}